{"code":"YL05","wikidata":"Q119723213","wikipedia":{"en":"Lat Phrao 83 MRT station","th":"สถานีลาดพร้าว 83"},"summary":{"en":"Lat Phrao 83 station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Lat Phrao Road, near Soi Lat Phrao 83 and Imperial World Ladprao shopping mall in Wang Thonglang District, Bangkok. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีลาดพร้าว 83 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนลาดพร้าวในพื้นที่เขตวังทองหลาง กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-06-12","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Lat_Phrao_83_Station_08.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_83_Station_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_83_Station_08.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Lat_Phrao_83_Station_01.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_83_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_83_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Lat_Phrao_83_Station_02.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_83_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_83_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Lat_Phrao_83_Station_03.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_83_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_83_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Lat_Phrao_83_Station_04.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_83_Station_04.jpg?utm_sou